# ── Go module checksums are a lock file, not build output ─────────────────────
# The repository root ignores `go.sum` generically. For a Go implementation that
# is wrong: without it `go mod download` cannot verify what it fetched and the
# build stops being reproducible. These two un-ignore it for this directory and
# everything under it (the service module and the BDD harness module).
!go.sum

# ── Build and test output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/bin/
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
__debug_bin*
